      players: '2, 3 or 4 (best for 3).',
      deck: '32 Xiangqi pieces mixed face down, arranged in stacks of two in a circle.',
      equipment: 'Chinese chess (Xiangqi) set of 32 pieces; table.',
      dealing: 'Starting player determined by turning one stack face up and counting by total value. Players take stacks clockwise until each has two stacks; first player takes a third stack, then each takes one piece from next stacks so each has 5 pieces. Pieces held face down in a row.',
